    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Learn Chinese with a quiz that helps you review common Chinese characters you will come across in everyday text. By practicing and reviewing, you can learn 2,538 Hanzi, their meanings and pronunciations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> All questions have a timer set between 2 and 20 seconds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Choose how many questions per quiz. From 3 to 30.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> The following levels are available: 1 to 8 strokes, 9 to 16 strokes, 17 to 24 strokes, any Hanzi from the list or even your own custom list.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> You can review any Hanzi to check its pinyin or the traditional form.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 3 ways to take a quiz: guess a Hanzi's meaning or its pronunciations; Also you can have a word in English and then choose the matching Hanzi.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Achievements available to highlight your progress!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Learn Chinese with a quiz that helps you review common Chinese characters you will come across in everyday text. By practicing and reviewing, you can learn 2,538 Hanzi, their meanings and pronunciations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> All questions have a timer set between 2 and 20 seconds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Choose how many questions per quiz. From 3 to 30.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> The following levels are available: 1 to 8 strokes, 9 to 16 strokes, 17 to 24 strokes, any Hanzi from the list or even your own custom list.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> You can review any Hanzi to check its pinyin or the traditional form.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 3 ways to take a quiz: guess a Hanzi's meaning or its pronunciations; Also you can have a word in English and then choose the matching Hanzi.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Achievements available to highlight your progress!</p>",
